     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Organization ExampleNMDPDonorCenter</b></p><a name=\"ExampleNMDPDonorCenter\"> </a><a name=\"hcExampleNMDPDonorCenter\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-nmdp-organization.html\">NMDP Organization</a></p></div><p><b>identifier</b>: <code>http://terminology.nmdp.org/codesystem/donor-center</code>/12345</p><p><b>active</b>: true</p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://fhir.nmdp.org/ig/donor-patient/CodeSystem/nmdp-center-type donor-center}\">Donor Center</span></p><p><b>name</b>: Minneapolis Blood Center</p></div>"
